### Key Features Implemented:

✓ All pages follow consistent neo-brutalist design
✓ Category-specific color themes:
  - Road Signs: Yellow (amber-400)
  - Road Traffic: Blue (blue-400)
  - Priority: Red (red-400)
  - Driving: Green (green-400)
  - Technical: Orange (orange-400)
  - Loading: Cyan (cyan-400)
  - General Knowledge: Purple (purple-400)
  - Emergency: Red (red-500)

✓ Responsive design for all devices (mobile, tablet, desktop)
✓ 16:9 image aspect ratio enforcement
✓ Collapsible topics and questions
✓ Audio player with language switching (EN/KH)
✓ Proper text wrapping with break-words and overflow-wrap-anywhere
✓ Close buttons on popups (top corner X + bottom Close button)
✓ Law reference sections
✓ Sub-group filtering
✓ Search functionality

### Special Features:

- Priority page: Grid layout like Road Signs (visual learning with intersection diagrams)
- General Knowledge: Learning Resources section with PDF/Link filtering
- Emergency: Emergency Contacts section with clickable phone numbers

### Architecture:
- Learn pages (/learn/*) = Study/Learning hub with Q&A
- Play section (/play/*) = Quizzes/Tests/Challenges (to be built later)
- Same content used in both but different presentation

